r of  sword helmepo and navy HQ commander and  member of Sword Peabody are begging for  Navy HQ rear Admiral and member of Sword  Prince Grouse and his forces to help  rescue Kobe from Pirate Island where  Blackbeard is and it must be noted how  mepo is crying hard however it's pointed  out that Pirate Island as I mentioned is  yonko Blackbeard's Turf and that they'll  get sworn by Pirates if they stick their  nose into that beehive to be fair though  even if they don't like Kobe personally  this does not look good for the Marines  having one of their own kidnapped let  alone a hero of theirs so the Marines  should definitely make his return a  priority if at all possible for Public  Image if not for Kobe him self how mepo  says that Egghead is close so can't they  deploy a seraphim as alluded to in the  title Egghead is vegapunk's Island which  is near so we're maybe looking at a  helmeppo Luffy Alliance here to help  save Kobe from Blackbeard not sure but  it should be interesting to see where  this goes nonetheless I really don't  think it's a coincidence though that  these two are so close together right  now for now though the answer how mepo  gets is that they need to calm down for  a minute Prince comments on how they  can't even get a hold of Drake either  they're no position to act right now  again as if reminding us that another  one of Kobe's friends is nearby we jump  to Luffy's group Next Luffy is hilarious  in the sense that he can't even remember  who Bonnie is even though she's also a  member of the worst generation but at  least they appear to be safe now they're  on dry land although they're not dry  themselves we see Bonnie and she's  taking her adult form again as she's  trying to dry her clothes even though  Sanji would be losing his mind here  Luffy completely ignores the fact that  she's shirtless she says to Luffy their  enemies but also thanks him for saving  her bacon and Luffy hilariously calm  comments don't sweat it Boogie Luffy is  messing around having a good time and  commenting on how it's so cold and  Bonnie can't help but remark Are you  seriously an emperor and that's what I  love about this part of the story before  the yako seemed aloof serious and cool  but now that our protagonist is ayanko  we see how even though other people may  see him that way who haven't met him  he's still the same very human character  we've come to know so well Yanko or not  and I'm sure Goldie Roger was a similar  story for those who knew him the best  Bonnie also asks Luffy about his hair  and how it's not white like in his  wanted poster she says they made quite a  stir about it in the newspapers which  makes me wonder if word about the sun  god returning and joy boy returning has  started to spread Luffy comments that's  just how he looks when he's totally free  interesting choice of words there  definitely not huge mind-blowing  dialogue right here but very interesting  nonetheless when Bonnie asks about Luffy  not being worried about the rest of his  crew Luffy just laughs saying they'll  figure it out he has faith in them after  all you know sora's not gonna let  anything go down meanwhile Bonnie still  can't believe that Luffy got the Knight  of the sea jinbei with him as well  jimbei asks what happened to her ship  and crew only to be told that she came  alone the metal shark that almost  gobbled up the straw hat ship also  gobbled up her ship and then she says  she's starving something she's got in  common with Luffy finally Bonnie lets  them know where they are she says this  is a government Island they're on  Egghead the island that's set to be 500  years in the future as a Sci-Fi fan AKA  a huge fan of Science Fiction I'm so  excited to see how creative Oda will get  here this seems to be a great  opportunity for Oda to really Flex his  creative muscles by being able to show  us how 500 years into the future would  look Bonnie adds Vega Punk's research  lab is based here and reveals that Vega  punks the reason she's here they've got  business not surprising when you  remember Bonnie cry over Kuma during the  reverie we return to the rest of the  crew and the ship the mecca robot has  lifted them up Frankie obviously loves  the Mecca and so do I honestly it's it's  awesome then a figure steps out of the  robot they are vexed at the fact that  the shark keeps trying to swallow ships  saying maybe overriding Primal desires  is simply impossible clearly this is a  mad scientist who can't even stop  thinking about their work as they're  introducing themselves to strangers  Frankie thanks the figure for saving  them the figure removes their goggles  while saying they ordered the mecca  shark to scout report and fire but if it  keeps trying to eat chips there won't be  anything to salvage I must have bungled  the programming end quote we finally see  the full body and this mad scientist is  revealed to be a beautiful woman she  says forgive me but did you say I just  saved you oh you naive Pirates I work  for the government despite my mediocrity  they like to call me their scientific  genius you can call me Dr vegapunk and  there you have it the first reveal of  vegapunk after hundreds and hundreds of  chapters Vega Punk has been built up so  much this is truly a big moment in one  history and I can't wait to see how this  Arc goes obviously we gotta spend some  time on this futuristic Island and  learning more about vegapunk but it's  clear that helmeppo is so close and that  Luffy would want to save Kobe too so I  can't wait to see where exactly we go  from here definitely glad that they  introduced yet another waifu into the  story but who would have thought it  would be vegapunk obviously most of us  thought it would be emu summer but back  to vegapunk I love her character so far  and even how she clearly appears to be  modest even as she's considered the  greatest scientist ever place your bets  on how old the scientist actually is  since with science I assume m